            "review_title": "Review at Beefsteak TiTi",
            "review_text": "Thắng Nguyễn\n7 contributions\n0\nBeefsteak TiTi\nJun 2019 • Friends\nBest beefsteak in town with a comfortable price when you only have a few bucks left in your bucket. Warm atmosphere, friendly waiter & waitress. \nI ordered a medium rare beefsteak with pepper sauce. It was perfect done with tender and juicy, spicy sauce, crispy french fries, fresh salad. \nI’m quite sure you all will enjoy this in a rainy day.\nWritten July 3, 2019",
